[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Public entry points** (from `nm -D`, both are tested directly — the low-level
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m scanner is *not* only reached through the wrapper):
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
