[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `0xC2..0xDF`, `0xE0..0xEF` with the `0xE0`/`0xED` second-byte splits at `0xA0`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `0xF0..0xF4` with the splits at `0x90`/`0x8F`).
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Count of invalid bytes vs. the `REPLACEMENT_INC = 4096` / `repl < 3`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   accounting: `0`, `1`, `2`, `1364`, `1365`, `1366`, `2729..2731`, `≫ 4096`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (`repl` goes `0 → 4096 → 4093 → … → 1 → 4097 → 4094 → …`, so the realloc
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   cadence is 1365 replacements the first time and 1366 thereafter — a genuinely
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   value-dependent code path.)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Total length vs. 4096: below, exactly, above.
